      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Vyolynce\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/vyolynce/48/2397_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Vyolynce:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Does the fact that they read \"Prejudice and Pride\" when paried up like this drive anybody else crazy?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It does…</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Christopher\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/48/1851_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Christopher:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Not from her&nbsp;perspective.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>And now, thanks to that thought, it doesn't!</p>",
